  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 87492124672
    m_Localized: Hello? Are speakers working?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85051039744
    m_Localized: Give me some nods if they are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 736287421095936
    m_Localized: Oh they are. Great to see you my new investigators.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 736760307900416
    m_Localized: You ended up here for a lot reasons. Some not by their choice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 737518629675008
    m_Localized: But fear not beacause under my managment, no talent goes to waste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 737722019864576
    m_Localized: Togheter we will help our city survive. Be proud!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
